"Caden is unchosen-sighted-{~?~} to the augera: the one person wholly free of prophetic links."
"Caden was once a Foundation of the Prophecy; his father's orb and the augera cut him loose."
"A Fateweaver stripped Caden's augeric shell and wiped him from his five friends' memories."
"Caden works in oblivion: he unravels sequences, phases, reads threads and heals by instinct."
"Caden trains in secret with the Demiurge, in return for an unnamed future favour."
"Caden hides the twins' eldritch-glyphed silver knife, even from the Demiurge."
"Caden killed attackers and passersby in Geldor by breaking a military sequence; guilt haunts him."
"Caden needs solitude to think, and slips into a dissociated calm after great shocks."
"Caden vows to free the augera, unmake prophecies, and save his sister and father."
"Caden has a two-week trade with Bertram, lessons for information, and lunch with Leyla tomorrow."
"Now: Caden is in his dorm room at night with Ambrose, reconciling as allies against the Fateweavers."
"Ambrose is the Chosen One of the Major Prophecy; his flare is Chosen-Blinded-Jailer."
"Ambrose is fated to replace a dying Fateweaver; spider-like limbs now grow from his flare."
"Ambrose grew up in a Lighthaven orphanage and began the Art at sixteen, told of the Prophecy."
"Ambrose is the strongest thaumaturge of his year; he has pierced the veil into oblivion."
"Ambrose led the Six in trapping and breaking the lake's wild augera; its core went into Emilia."
"Nightwatchers under Ms Pearl guard Ambrose; they taught him an ultimate defence sequence."
"Ambrose loves the Art above all, and doubts whether that love is his own or the Prophecy's."
"Ambrose forgot Caden as a friend, but sees that Caden jumbles the threads around him."
"Now: Ambrose is in his dorm room at night, weeping after confessing to Caden, asking to be allies."
"Devon's flare is now broken-skilful-bridge, once warm-skilful-bridge; a wild augera shard is in it."
"Devon is an anchor of the Six-Chained-Foundations and has the best control after Ambrose."
"Devon longs to cook for a living; the Duke barred him from kitchens and pushed him to the Art."
"Devon once thought of ending his life; his mother talked him down."
"The Geldor augera once lent Devon power to freeze agents in stasis and hide his friends."
"Devon ran from home with his friends to hunt a wild augera; his father revoked his keys."
"Devon knows Caden opposes the Prophecy; he is wary of Caden, yet keeps his secrets."
"Now: Devon has retired to his room in the dorm after cooking the dorm's dinner."
"Jerric's flare is cold-strong-watcher; he is an anchor of the Six-Chained-Foundations."
"Jerric's mother drowned in a lake when he was twelve; the lake augera took on her likeness."
"Jerric once tried to drown himself at the Academy lake; her spectre stopped him three times."
"Jerric, a precise theorist, devised a perceptual-plane prison and a detection pulse."
"Jerric would have been a Sage had the Academy not forced everyone into thaumaturgy."
"Jerric once tangled Kevan's flare in arcanic space, and was badly hurt by Lynus after."
"Now: Jerric is reading at the dorm dining table, reserved toward Caden."
"Kevan's flare is tangled-broken-power, once tangled-anger-power; he is an anchor of the Six."
"Kevan dates Emilia; they came together after their great arena duel."
"Their father caned Kevan as a child; Kevan later learned Lynus used to let him win."
"Kevan wields black arcanic lightning and once lost control of it mid-duel."
"The Academy augera gave the twins say over Caden's fate, and glyphs for a knife to kill him."
"Kevan now defers to Ambrose and is calmer and more respectful than before."
"Now: Kevan is walking Emilia back to her dormitory at night, with Lynus."
"Lynus' flare is bitter-proud-pain; he is an anchor of the Six and the stronger thaumaturge."
"Lynus once stabbed at Caden's body with the glyphed knife; Caden later healed his wound."
"Lynus built a concealment envelope as a way to escape the Prophecy by death."
"Lynus hides by modulating the local arcanic field; Henry likely taught him a Special Set stasis."
"Lynus is passive-aggressive and nosy, and fears being made to kill his brother."
"Now: Lynus is with Kevan, seeing Emilia back to her dormitory."
"Emilia's flare is brilliant-sighted-singer; she is sighted and perceives the higher planes."
"Emilia replaced Caden in the Six as the one brought close, the bones of Ambrose's crown."
"The core of the broken lake augera now lives inside Emilia."
"Emilia, an ex-gymnast and dancer, works arcana through breath and body; she is blunt and literal."
"Emilia dates Kevan and has lately threatened Lynus."
"Emilia shares Caden's tutorial group and remembers him only from their shared classes."
"Now: Emilia is being walked back to her own dormitory by Kevan and Lynus."
"Bertram's flare is clever-potent-needle."
"Bertram runs an illicit artefact trade and sells 'partner-only information'."
"Reeves is Bertram's patron; Bertram knows the professors play a game to pick the next Demiurge."
"Bertram's father is a detective, perhaps on his trail; his mother died when Bertram was ten."
"Bertram's brother serves in the Imperial Army; his sister is in her final year of engineering."
"Bertram scribes his scanning pulse at oblivion's edge without knowing it."
"Now: Bertram is most likely in his dorm; he was last seen in a privacy bubble at the library cafe."
"Leyla may be Bertram's partner in trade; she sought the Nivordin array diagram."
"Leyla once gave Emilia reading advice; Caden knew her, and feigned not to."
"Leyla takes thaumaturgy with Kant this term."
"Now: Leyla is most likely in her dorm; she has lunch set with Caden at the library cafe tomorrow."
"Henry has chased Bertram's Top Scorer place for two years and is his rival."
"Henry leads the twins' gestalt in Kant's class; the twins take his scolding meekly."
"In Kant's war game Henry abandoned Caden and Bertram, who dropped a roof on his group."
"Henry is unctuous now and shot Caden a predatory grin; Caden dodged him after healing class."
"Now: Henry is most likely in his dorm on campus after the first day of classes."
"Erika is in Kant's thirty-strong thaumaturgy group with Caden, Bertram and the twins."
"Erika closely analysed Caden's technique alongside Henry after the war game."
"Now: Erika is most likely in her dorm on campus after the first day of classes."
"Reyes shares Caden's tutorial group and his Thaumaturgy and Advanced Glyphs classes."
"Reyes casts a reflective shield; he, Emilia and Caden lasted longest in their first bout with Kant."
"Reyes joked in Celwyn's class about a glyph of ultimate power."
"Reyes was the last to book the arena before the winter break."
"Now: Reyes is most likely in his dorm, back for conscripted thaumaturgy training."
"Triss sequences fast and fired twin beams at Kant; Emilia uses a beam sequence named for her."
"Triss failed Reeves' second-week ensorcelment trial, but all first-years passed at term's end."
"Now: Triss is most likely in her dorm on campus, back for the second term."
"Petyr was in Caden's first tutorial group and fell to invisible bolts in the bout with Kant."
"Petyr passed Reeves' end-of-term ensorcelment test, as every first-year did."
"Now: Petyr is most likely on campus, since nearly every first-year returned for conscription."
